    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What would make a great hero like Achilles harvest olives for an ordinary market woman? What would drive the great Greek heroes to become ordinary couriers? The desire for fame and adventure, of course!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431630/extras/4f3b9d892267cc132814df3e5f64c345.poster.avif?t=1739817126\" width=266 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431630/extras/4f3b9d892267cc132814df3e5f64c345.webm?t=1739817126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431630/extras/4f3b9d892267cc132814df3e5f64c345.mp4?t=1739817126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ahapika is the most heroic agency in Greece, and only the most valorous and glorious are accepted.\u00a0Follow the path of its origin from the very beginning!\u00a0You will have to fulfill the requests and orders of both ordinary mortals and the great Olympian gods.\u00a0But be careful - sometimes an innocent request to deliver a package can lead to fatal consequences.\u00a0Fight with beasts and monsters, argue with gods and titans, gather the best heroes to help.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431630/extras/98c92526270b095d548057b2ebbab27b.poster.avif?t=1739817126\" width=334 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431630/extras/98c92526270b095d548057b2ebbab27b.webm?t=1739817126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431630/extras/98c92526270b095d548057b2ebbab27b.mp4?t=1739817126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An exciting story</strong>:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In your adventures, you will immerse yourself in the multifaceted world of intrigues and mysteries of Ancient Greece. When carrying out the orders of the gods, be careful: the proud inhabitants of Olympus do not forgive mistakes and may hold a grudge against you for a long time. You will have to understand what a new mysterious prophecy means to the world, and, of course, fight in the great final battle. It depends only on your actions which side you will be on, and who will come to the rescue at this hour.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431630/extras/98e65948a7d4e6a53ff883ad2554b953.poster.avif?t=1739817126\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431630/extras/98e65948a7d4e6a53ff883ad2554b953.webm?t=1739817126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431630/extras/f8c3c97c9d589d77d58a79aaa740a453.poster.avif?t=1739817126\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431630/extras/f8c3c97c9d589d77d58a79aaa740a453.webm?t=1739817126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431630/extras/cb9af106033f803527860984bcf8dae1.poster.avif?t=1739817126\" width=128 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431630/extras/cb9af106033f803527860984bcf8dae1.webm?t=1739817126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Classic bullet heaven battles:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many different heroes, various weapons, hordes of enemies, powerful amulets and Divine Gifts! More than 50 unique story tasks! Fight and unlock new heroes. Be prepared for the fact that powerful forces may intervene in the battle, both to help you and to counteract. Hone your skills on the arena in endless mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431630/extras/61e0549757d625ebf15c67a363f8a777.avif?t=1739817126\" data-has-big width=800 height=428 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to &quot;<strong>AHAPIKA - Heroic Agency</strong>&quot;!</h2>",
