4?t=1739817126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An exciting story</strong>:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In your adventures, you will immerse yourself in the multifaceted world of intrigues and mysteries of Ancient Greece. When carrying out the orders of the gods, be careful: the proud inhabitants of Olympus do not forgive mistakes and may hold a grudge against you for a long time. You will have to understand what a new mysterious prophecy means to the world, and, of course, fight in the great final battle. It depends only on your actions which side you will be on, and who will come to the rescue at this hour.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431630/extras/98e65948a7d4e6a53ff883ad2554b953.poster.avif?t=1739817126\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431630/extras/98e65948a7d4e6a53ff883ad2554b953.webm?t=1739817126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431630/extras/f8c3c97c9d589d77d58a79aaa740a453.poster.avif?t=1739817126\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431630/extras/f8c3c97c9d589d77d58a79aaa740a453.webm?t=1739817126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431630/extras/cb9af106033f803527860984bcf8dae1.poster.avif?t=1739817126\" width=128 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431630/extras/cb9af106033f803527860